<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">If
an emerging growth company, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying
with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span id="xdx_903_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20260323__20260323_zbpF9io4wxo1"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-03-23" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000033" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

